# Frontend Next.js

- App Router (Next.js 15); componentes funcionais + hooks
- UI fiel a `design-references/` quando `design.status: approved`
- Tailwind + Radix/shadcn; tokens migrados de `design-tokens.css`
- TanStack Query para cache/refresh de filas
- Testes: Vitest + React Testing Library
- Mapas: Google Maps Platform (MVP)
- A11y: replicar padrões de `filasaude-a11y.js` (skip, focus trap, tabs ARIA)
